{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1467030-coin-collection","id":1467030,"title":"Coin Collection","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-07T02:06:09-08:00","id":1467030,"title":"Coin Collection","content":"So I was thinking that basically any skill, hobby, or etc. could be made useful to hunters given the right circumstances. With that in mind, I chose a hobby (at least I perceive it as a hobby) &amp; have done my best to come up with as many plot hooks as I can.<br /> <br /> ***<br /> <br /> 1: There once was a malicious demon that systematically destroyed people's lives for fun. Then it disappeared. In the present day, a cult &amp; your cell have seperately uncovered what happened to the demon. It was imprisoned in a set of limited edition coins, from which the cult means to now release the demon.<br /> <br /> 2: Your cell has been encountered a murderous ghost. After some research, it is determined that one of its anchors is the coin collection that it possessed when alive.<br /> <br /> 3: Your cell has made contact with a technologically-advanced, subterranean civilization. Upon debating amongst yourselves, you conclude that violence here is a very bad option (us surface dwellers would likely lose &amp; die in vast numbers), so you make a play for diplomacy. For some reason, the civilization prizes coin collecting so you build part of your approach around that.<br /> <br /> 4: A friend yours who is very into coin collecting recently acquired a new piece for their collection. Since then they've become surprisingly charismatic, but elements of what appear to be megalomania are creeping into their personality.<br /> <br /> 5: A friend of yours is aging at an accelerated rate. When asked how, they confess they don't know, but it started after a particular coin disappeared from their collection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-07T15:44:58-08:00","id":1467116,"title":"","content":"So I've decided to tackle some other hobbies, coming up with potential plot hooks to use.<br /> For the most part I'm just going to do what I can, but are there particular hobbies that people want me to tackle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-07T17:03:45-08:00","id":1467124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1467030-coin-collection?p=1467116#post1467116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've decided to tackle some other hobbies, coming up with potential plot hooks to use.<br /> For the most part I'm just going to do what I can, but are there particular hobbies that people want me to tackle?</div> </div> </div> </div>Fly fishing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-16T09:37:13-08:00","id":1468014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1467030-coin-collection?p=1467124#post1467124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fly fishing.</div> </div> </div> </div>You recently found yourself going fly fishing with some friends. One of the fish you caught was very unusual &amp; none of you could identify it. The lot of you ended up taking a picture of the fish &amp; then returning it to the water.<br /> When you got home you found that very fish in your fridge. Your partner cooked a meal with it. Everyone who ate of that meal has gotten sick. The fish, despite being cooked &amp; eaten, is still in your fridge, intact &amp; uncooked, despite you having outright thrown the whole thing into the garbage.<br /> <br /> There's this guy who has been seen fly fishing at a particular river, every Spring, for as long as anyone can remember. There's no way he could be a normal guy, because in all that time he's shown no signs of aging, &amp; it's just been so long that there should have been some.<br /> Recently, kids have started going missing. Last time any of them were seen was around that particular river, &amp; the perpetual fisherman is looking healthier than you remember him ever looking before.<br /> <br /> You are an avid fly fisher, going out on a weekly basis if possible. You've started trying out a new fly. Whenever you attach one on the rod, you get the faintest feeling that you can hear screaming. Screaming of pain &amp; terror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}